        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>World Sprint</strong> is a fast-paced 3D endless runner packed with action, challenge, and style!<br>Dash through vibrant worlds — from scorching deserts to bustling cities and soaring skies — as you dodge obstacles, collect coins, and chase your next high score.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🌟 <strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Six unique levels</strong> with increasing difficulty — from relaxing runs to intense sprints.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Five powerful upgrades</strong> to boost your run:<br>🪙 <i>Double Coins</i> – Earn twice as much with every pickup.<br>⏳ <i>Slow Motion</i> – Bend time to dodge tricky obstacles.<br>🧲 <i>Coin Magnet</i> – Pull in coins from all around you.<br>🛡️ <i>Invincibility</i> – Stay safe from all obstacles for a limited time.<br>❤️ <i>Revive</i> – Get back in the race after a fall.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unlockable levels, characters, and pets</strong> — </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pets automatically collect coins as you run!</p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>In-game shop</strong> — purchase new characters and pets with coins earned through gameplay (no real money required).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Local leaderboards</strong> — track your personal bests and challenge your friends to beat your scores.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Achievements</strong> — complete challenges and earn stars to show off your progress.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Smooth controls</strong> — jump, slide, and sprint to avoid obstacles and keep your run alive.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🕹️ <strong>Easy to Learn, Hard to Master</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you’re after a casual experience or a skill-based challenge, <strong>World Sprint</strong> offers endless replay ability. Perfect your timing, unlock everything, and see how long you can last!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you conquer every challenge and become the ultimate sprinter?</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>World Sprint</strong> is a fast-paced 3D endless runner packed with action, challenge, and style!<br>Dash through vibrant worlds — from scorching deserts to bustling cities and soaring skies — as you dodge obstacles, collect coins, and chase your next high score.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🌟 <strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Six unique levels</strong> with increasing difficulty — from relaxing runs to intense sprints.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Five powerful upgrades</strong> to boost your run:<br>🪙 <i>Double Coins</i> – Earn twice as much with every pickup.<br>⏳ <i>Slow Motion</i> – Bend time to dodge tricky obstacles.<br>🧲 <i>Coin Magnet</i> – Pull in coins from all around you.<br>🛡️ <i>Invincibility</i> – Stay safe from all obstacles for a limited time.<br>❤️ <i>Revive</i> – Get back in the race after a fall.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unlockable levels, characters, and pets</strong> — </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pets automatically collect coins as you run!</p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>In-game shop</strong> — purchase new characters and pets with coins earned through gameplay (no real money required).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Local leaderboards</strong> — track your personal bests and challenge your friends to beat your scores.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Achievements</strong> — complete challenges and earn stars to show off your progress.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Smooth controls</strong> — jump, slide, and sprint to avoid obstacles and keep your run alive.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🕹️ <strong>Easy to Learn, Hard to Master</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you’re after a casual experience or a skill-based challenge, <strong>World Sprint</strong> offers endless replay ability. Perfect your timing, unlock everything, and see how long you can last!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you conquer every challenge and become the ultimate sprinter?</p>",
